# Grant-O-Matic agent rules

- Follow `AGENTS.md` and the active prompt under `docs/agent-chain/prompts/`.
- Never invent grant programs, amounts, deadlines, or eligibility. Cite URLs from `docs/agent-chain/SOURCES.md` only after fetch confirmation.
- Verify/audit prompts (`*a-verify*`, `*a-audit*`, `99-*`, `META-*`) must not add features; report findings and apply minimal fixes only when verification fails.
- New modules require unit and API/integration tests. Scraper tests use recorded fixtures, not live network calls in CI.
- Do not skip tests. Do not commit secrets. Do not force-push or rewrite shared history.
- Before opening a PR, run the verify commands listed in the active phase prompt.
- Update `docs/agent-chain/HANDOFF.md` at phase end.
